run PreEmergencyDelegationPersistenceScenario for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance
run EmergencyBypassFIFOScenario for 5 State, 3 User, 2 Administrator, 3 Role, 3 Request, 3 Delegation, 3 Object, 1 EmergencyPrivilege, 3 Clearance

